k;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/* --- BOTTOM SECTION: 3 IMAGE GALLERY --- *\/\r\n    .ct-living-gallery {\r\n        display: grid;\r\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; \/* 3 Equal columns *\/\r\n        gap: 5px; \/* Tiny gap between images *\/\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .ct-living-gallery img {\r\n        width: 100%;\r\n        height: 220px; \/* Fixed height to make them all even *\/\r\n        object-fit: cover; \/* Ensures images don't stretch *\/\r\n        border-radius: 2px;\r\n        display: block;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/* --- MOBILE RESPONSIVE --- *\/\r\n    @media (max-width: 768px) {\r\n        .ct-living-top {\r\n            flex-direction: column; \/* Stack vertically *\/\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        .ct-living-map {\r\n            max-width: 100%;\r\n            width: 100%;\r\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .ct-living-gallery {\r\n            grid-template-columns: 1fr; \/* Stack images one by one on phone *\/\r\n            gap: 15px;\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n<\/style>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ct-living-wrapper\">\r\n    \r\n    <h2>Living in PhnomPenh<\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"ct-living-top\">\r\n        <div class=\"ct-living-text\">\r\n            <p>\r\n                Wherever your studies take you, with CamTech University you\u2019ll find a supportive and dynamic home in Phnom Penh. Located in the growing Chroy Chongvar Satellite City, our campus offers safe, modern, and affordable options for international students. You can enjoy a stress-free living experience close to the city\u2019s vibrant culture, caf\u00e9s, and services.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n            <p>\r\n                Whether you want to stay year-round or only during your study sessions, CamTech offers a variety of options: from nearby modern condominiums (through our Canadia Group partnership) to apartments with shared facilities. You\u2019ll be at the heart of the action \u2013 just minutes away from Phnom Penh\u2019s riverside, cultural landmarks, shops, and student hangouts.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"ct-living-map\">\r\n            <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/Map-in-Phnom-Penh-scaled.png\" alt=\"Map of Phnom Penh Location\">\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"ct-living-gallery\">\r\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.unesco.org\/sites\/default\/files\/national_museum.jpg\" alt=\"National Museum Phnom Penh\">\r\n        \r\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/cms.siemreaper.com\/uploads\/Phnom_Penh_Walk_Street3_a571c3bceb.jpg\">\r\n        \r\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/images.unsplash.com\/photo-1554118811-1e0d58224f24?q=80&w=800&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"Brown Coffee Shop\">\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n<\/div>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-be8a29b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"be8a29b\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d8f078f e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"d8f078f\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e93ca42 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"e93ca42\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/plugins\/elementor\/assets\/images\/placeholder.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Accommodation Information As a guide, the recommended monthly living cost for a sing